          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Jessene",
            text: _("Haldric, messengers just informed me that the fleet has returned from our old home. They came back with as nearly as large a fleet as we initially set out with, and Southbay still stands. This is excellent news. As per your orders a third of the fleet has headed back out."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("That is excellent news indeed. Our numbers have doubled. Now on to the business at hand."),
          },
